// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3386128672" "You check the crate contents."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P691235216" "The crate contains nothing more than some heavy duty construction tools."
// InteractActionString :
"P3571391747" "Checking the crate's contents..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1913394580" "This crate doesn't seem to be filled with anything of value to the Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FindCrates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P520478333" "The crate contains several fragile looking glass bulbs for lighting fixtures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FindCrates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4146532422" "The crate contains nothing more than spare parts for machinery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - FindOpenedCrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3338559794" "Find what the Resistance is here for."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2421476980" "The crate appears to have already been opened. Inside there is a hard plastic lining that is molded to hold some sort of heavy firearm or cannon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P519029566" "This crate used to contain several heavy weapons... But where have they disappeared to?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2087853950" "You took down the tail end of the Resistance raid on Novahold Storage. It appears that the majority got away with a slew of hi-tech weapons, but you found out that <color orange>they are heading to Gravatech Labs</color> next."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4096353919" "Ambush Resistance in Gravatech Labs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3972530195" "Sounds like the Resistance is moving quickly. Well you need to move faster. <color orange>Get into Gravatech Labs before they arrive and set up an ambush for them</color>. You stop them cold, when nobody is the wiser, and the people will love you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P47117358" "It looks like you arrived well ahead of the Resistance. Now to set the place up to show off your warm welcome for the uninvited guests."

