// Variable - ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2683771741" "You annihilated the attacking Resistance assault teams and saved Gravatech Labs from having their labs destroyed as well as their valuable data stolen... by the Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2517793947" "Flawless. Seriously, flawless. First you single-handedly quell the riot, then you disappear in a rush, spawning a rumormill amongst the press. The PPD responds to a break-in at Novahold Storage, but when they got there they just find Resistance strewn all over the place, thanks to your handiwork. And finally, you thwart an attack on Gravatech Labs that nobody even knew was happening.<br><br>I admit it, I'm impressed. Powers Division is buzzing about you, and so is the public.<br><br>But this latest situation makes me wonder; what could the Resistance want with Gravatech's latest hovertech engine... and what are they doing with a Syfotine Industries model 990 data storage device? I have a feeling that the rabbit you've been chasing lives in a much deeper hole than you realize, {HeroName}."
// RandomFameString :
"P161056294" "Is that...?<em>It is! It's {HeroName}!<em>I saw you on TPN today.<em>You are totally awesome!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTreeWarrant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4253324502" "The way I see it, if you just rush off to Syfotine Industries you're probably going to walk into more than you can handle."
// Answer Text :
"P4287487858" "Send the PPD in first."
// Answer Text :
"P2197477247" "Why don't you come with me?"
// Page PPDPage1 Text :
"P1540604589" "Oh, that's a good idea. But that could end up burning you later, especially if it's more than they can handle."
// Answer Text :
"P2700411605" "We need a way to anonymously tip them off."
// Page WarrantPage1 Text :
"P1854889298" "No, that'd be a bad idea. I'd steal your thunder. They know me, they'd figure you were just helping me out."
// Answer Text :
"P1721932053" "Well, how about the PPD, then?"
// Page PPDPage2 Text :
"P2755855118" "That's a better idea. But... it could end up burning you later, especially if it's more than they can handle."
// Page SeerPage1 Text :
"P1106323036" "I know just how to do that. The PPD responds rapidly to any Seer reports of crime in progress, generally because it is of a violent nature.<br><br>But in addition, I know a Seer who has a hard time filtering thoughts from voices. You plant the idea in her head that something is going on in Syfotine Industries and nobody will be able to sift a memory of you out of the soup in her head."
// Answer Text :
"P4013706636" "Sounds good, then I can swoop in and not only stop the bad guys, but save the PPD as well."
// Page FinishedPage1 Text :
"P3212179757" "Sounds like a solid plan."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTreeseer0511 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P448373799" "...I just love the way Enriche tastes, don't you?<br>...We have a meeting in thirty minutes, make sure to read the report on...<br>...Kevin, do these pants make me look fat?"
// Answer Text :
"P2270411767" "Resistance. Syfotine Industries. Forced Entry. Innocents in danger. Gunfire."
// Page SyfotinePage1 Text :
"P1058372311" "...Don't roll your eyes at me...<br><br>Attention Network: This is Seer 0511. Syfotine Industries requires immediate PPD response. Resistance forces have occupied the building. Innocents are in danger. Gunfire has been reported.<br><br>...Mom, I don't want to log in to school today, can't I play Guardians of Praetoria online today with Jonny? We're almost level..."
// Answer Text :
"P2546545012" "Good girl."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3665701430" "My guess is that <color orange>the Resistance are working with someone in Syfotine Industries</color>, but to what end I can't put my finger on. I think it's good you came to me before charging off to Syfotine Industries, who knows what is really going on down there.<br><br><color orange>We need to think on this a bit first</color>, make sure you don't bite off more than you can handle."
// AcceptString :
"P597515137" "Discuss options with Warrant"
// SendOffString :
"P3586410334" "I have a few ideas, but I want to hear yours as well. We've got to act fast though, the PPD may learn what we do about Syfotine Industries and then they could steal your thunder."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2565361775" "<color deepskyblue>Part 4: Path to Glory</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4099819219" "Let's hear what you have to say."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P254706117" "You hashed out a plan to minimize risk to yourself, and maximize the fame and power you can squeeze out of the current situation.<br><br>Your first order of business is the plant information in the seer network, and that means <color orange>visiting Seer 0511</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3532339543" "Visit Seer 0511"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3516765581" "Remember, Seer 0511 is a bit more detached than the other Seers. You can tell her exactly what to report and she wouldn't notice that it didn't come from her own mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1747024222" "The PPD have been alerted to the Resistance in Syfotine Industries. Once you arrive they should be softened up enough for you to take all the credit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2894312440" "Save Syfotine Industries"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1993686935" "The PPD have already responded and have arrived in Syfotine Industries. They're reporting meeting heavy resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3611804908" "You step over PPD officers and past walls riddled full of holes from assault weapons. Looks like it's up to you to save the day."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P1420915786" "You spend the next hour or so being interviewed by TPN reporters, endlessly rehashing your daring efforts to expose Claudia Michaels, the Chief Technology Officer of Syfotine Industries, as a member of the Syndicate. You also reveal her plot to ally with the Resistance and destroy one of her company's competitors, Gravatech Labs.<br><br>With the flash of cameras and the cheer of the assembled crowd you excuse yourself, claiming that your good deeds are needed elsewhere."

